    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >EASOAR is heavily inspired by certain 2D action platormers from the SNES era of gaming. With a focus on build variety and customisation with fast-paced action.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3229600/extras/5fa1986c23ff09c6b7ce316e4099b713.poster.avif?t=1744119773\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3229600/extras/5fa1986c23ff09c6b7ce316e4099b713.webm?t=1744119773\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3229600/extras/5fa1986c23ff09c6b7ce316e4099b713.mp4?t=1744119773\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Side-scrolling action with addicting gameplay. Climb up walls, jump over the heads of enemies and dash your way around like you're fresh out of hospital.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Demanding difficulty that has you fight tooth-and-nail in order to achieve victory, as a result of skill or well chosen build creation. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Become a master-of-arms as you purchase and stumble upon a vast array of weaponry to suit any playstyle you demand.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Witness surreal landscapes and fight horrible creations as a result of the innaturums, whether intentionally designed or not... </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore the vast array of build progression and customisation as you stare at stat screens for 30 minutes in order to get that 10% extra damage to achieve perfection. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Replayability is encouraged</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Innaturums:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You choose what kind of maniac wildslinger you are. But which innaturus power will you harness in your revolt against the Easoar Corporation?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3229600/extras/d58a502789165c33a0e6a63ad7dfd909.poster.avif?t=1744119773\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3229600/extras/d58a502789165c33a0e6a63ad7dfd909.webm?t=1744119773\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3229600/extras/d58a502789165c33a0e6a63ad7dfd909.mp4?t=1744119773\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>COFFIN [CF]</strong><br>Pure power and traps, destroy everything with purple bass and leave nothing in your wake.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>BOLIDE [BO]</strong><br>Buffs and healing, melt machinery with the power of bubbles and become a regenerating monster.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>ALDER [AL]</strong><br>Debuffs and Summoning, become a commander over machines and a herald of suffering with cyan radiation.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Customisation:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Equip a miriad of different weapons, bombs, dashes and augments. Literally just any junk you find on the ground. Make sure to dress your best, wildslingers have standards after all. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3229600/extras/ce45faff636e6bb8bb151c21f6151d05.poster.avif?t=1744119773\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3229600/extras/ce45faff636e6bb8bb151c21f6151d05.webm?t=1744119773\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3229600/extras/ce45faff636e6bb8bb151c21f6151d05.mp4?t=1744119773\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Weapons:</strong> Two can be equipped at once and can be swapped between. Wield Assault Rifles, Revolvers, Flamethrowers, Swords, Miniguns that fire waves of orange, carbonated bubbles!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Trinkets:</strong> Items with limited uses that replenish at checkpoints, plan their usage accordingly. They are everything, such as: Bombs, Throwing Knives, Throwing Axes, Robot Summons, Plant Seeds, Soda Cans, Mini-Volcanoes, Vials of Various, Sinister Goo. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Augments:</strong> Powerful stat upgrades that all require different space requirements in order to fit into your build. How you use their synergies with eachother is how you become unstoppable.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dashes:</strong> Movement upgrades that can either be passive or activated when dashing in mid-air. Dance around your foes or dash straight through them.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Stat Upgrades:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Weapons can be upgraded using materials found in levels. Stats can be increased to raise your affinity with a certain Innaturums, other stats like your maximum health or how many trinkets can be held at once.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Use every tool at your disposal to fight against Easoar and become a true force of innature!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3229600/extras/948b7dd3f3f35726314e85f4994ca265.poster.avif?t=1744119773\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3229600/extras/948b7dd3f3f35726314e85f4994ca265.webm?t=1744119773\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3229600/extras/948b7dd3f3f35726314e85f4994ca265.mp4?t=1744119773\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >EASOAR is heavily inspired by certain 2D action platormers from the SNES era of gaming. With a focus on build variety and customisation with fast-paced action.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3229600/extras/5fa1986c23ff09c6b7ce316e4099b713.poster.avif?t=1744119773\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3229600/extras/5fa1986c23ff09c6b7ce316e4099b713.webm?t=1744119773\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3229600/extras/5fa1986c23ff09c6b7ce316e4099b713.mp4?t=1744119773\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Side-scrolling action with addicting gameplay. Climb up walls, jump over the heads of enemies and dash your way around like you're fresh out of hospital.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Demanding difficulty that has you fight tooth-and-nail in order to achieve victory, as a result of skill or well chosen build creation. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Become a master-of-arms as you purchase and stumble upon a vast array of weaponry to suit any playstyle you demand.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Witness surreal landscapes and fight horrible creations as a result of the innaturums, whether intentionally designed or not... </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore the vast array of build progression and customisation as you stare at stat screens for 30 minutes in order to get that 10% extra damage to achieve perfection. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Replayability is encouraged</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Innaturums:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You choose what kind of maniac wildslinger you are. But which innaturus power will you harness in your revolt against the Easoar Corporation?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3229600/extras/d58a502789165c33a0e6a63ad7dfd909.poster.avif?t=1744119773\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3229600/extras/d58a502789165c33a0e6a63ad7dfd909.webm?t=1744119773\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3229600/extras/d58a502789165c33a0e6a63ad7dfd909.mp4?t=1744119773\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>COFFIN [CF]</strong><br>Pure power and traps, destroy everything with purple bass and leave nothing in your wake.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>BOLIDE [BO]</strong><br>Buffs and healing, melt machinery with the power of bubbles and become a regenerating monster.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>ALDER [AL]</strong><br>Debuffs and Summoning, become a commander over machines and a herald of suffering with cyan radiation.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Customisation:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Equip a miriad of different weapons, bombs, dashes and augments. Literally just any junk you find on the ground. Make sure to dress your best, wildslingers have standards after all. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3229600/extras/ce45faff636e6bb8bb151c21f6151d05.poster.avif?t=1744119773\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3229600/extras/ce45faff636e6bb8bb151c21f6151d05.webm?t=1744119773\" type=\"video/